{"resourceIdentifier":"3632","resourceName":"Eastern Cape Bamboo Forestry Project, South Africa","description":"South Africa's Eastern Cape has suffered over a century of land degradation, through a combination of clearance of the original ecosystem for livestock production, over intense grazing, and extended periods of drought. Such land degradation has gone hand in hand with increased levels of unemployment and poverty, with poverty in the province representing the highest in the country. Over the past ten years EcoPlanet has pioneered the use of a naturalized species of sympodial bamboo, Bambusa balcooa, as a tool for restoration of these degraded lands setting the framework for expansion. The proposed project activity uses a landscape approach to afforest extremely degraded farms that can no longer support agricultural activity, in a mosaic fashion. The project provides carbon removal benefits, enhanced ecosystem services, and long term job creation within a sub-municipality that current has >80% unemployment. The project is designed and managed hand in hand with the Eastern Cape Restoration Project, providing a holistic approach to restoration.","location":{"latitude":-33.516643,"longitude":26.660541},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-08-30","endExclusive":"2022-09-30","endInclusive":"2022-09-29"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3632"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Eastern Cape"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"EcoPlanet Bamboo Group, LLC"},{"type":"string","value":"DE, United States"},{"type":"string","value":"+254-721-999-604"},{"type":"string","value":"crebelo@ecoplanetbamboo.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"272471"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"10000 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV NORD CERT GmbH"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"01/10/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/10/2023 - 30/09/2053"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=72948&IDKEY=00e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9L100595292","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"Eastern Cape Bamboo Forestry Project PD DRAFT.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-08-25T08:03:05.78Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=72130&IDKEY=liquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfq99467270","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS Listing Representation Eastern Cape Bamboo Forestry Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-08-06T09:02:48.2Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=112431&IDKEY=j0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9f155042349","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"Registration-Representation-Eastern Cape Bamboo Forestry Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-05-08T07:49:53.697Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=139033&IDKEY=9kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj9099191726507","documentType":"Validation Report","documentName":"VCS ValR Project I